    "detailed_description": "A two-dimensional shooting game with a top view, which takes place in New York. You will play as a secret agent who is searching with his team for a secret elixir that allows you to gain immortality. In the game you will find a well-drawn pixel graphics, made in a retro style, a crowd of enemies, eager for your death and your gun.<br><br>The game is incredibly difficult and requires a lot of effort to complete the passage, and for good reason - because if you suddenly lose, you will have to start the whole level over again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of this game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A well-developed story that you will get to know on more than 8 levels.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Try a large number of weapons. It has everything from assault rifles to tire iron and knives.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A great, fast and powerful soundtrack consisting of more than 33 tracks from 3 different artists.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed character animations consisting of several frames.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each level can be completed in a completely different way.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game has a stealth system.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An unusual story with unexpected twists that will complement the gameplay.</li></ul>",
